WebApps/PhotoMeasurePro/00__ThirdParty__VersionLockedDependencies/00__DepthAnythingV2__Small__Onnx/*.onnx
WebApps/PhotoMeasurePro/00__ThirdParty__VersionLockedDependencies/01__MobileSAM__Onnx/*.onnx
WebApps/Prototypes__ToolTesting__EarlyStage/Prototype__DepthMapPhotoMeasure/01__ExternalDependencies__VersionLocked
